res\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250630070713&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sir_Leopold_2f354e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Sir Leopold.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Four seasons? Ha! Red is for blood, blue is for tears, green is for poison and yellow is for sweat! With those inks I will write your fate.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It spawns on the 23rd day of each month, exactly 30 minutes after <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Boot</a>. \n</p><p>Raid messages:\n</p>\n<ol><li><b>00:00:00</b>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Once more, the sinister Sir Leopold leads his henchmen out of the book pages to wreak havoc.</span></li>\n<li><b>00:10:00</b>: (unannounced raid)</li>\n<li><b>00:20:00</b>: (unannounced raid)</li>\n<li><b>00:30:00</b>: (unannounced raid) Sir Leopold appears</li></ol>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Self-Healing</span> (0-325)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">